<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第一幕 · 五层演变</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>五层是交付链上的五个控制面</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 24}}><Box style={{width: 384, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 32px", background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "PingFang SC", fontSize: 88, fontWeight: 700, color: "#A32D2D", lineHeight: 1.0}}>散</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", marginTop: 16}}>十个人十套配置</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 10}}>交付质量取决于今天是谁在敲键盘。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 744, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 18}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 20, alignItems: "flex-start", borderLeft: "3px solid #1C1F23", paddingLeft: 22}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", marginTop: 8}}>01</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>五层是交付链上的五个控制面</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>表达 / 所见 / 执行 / 反馈 / 编排——在团队里，它们往往散在不同人手上。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 20, alignItems: "flex-start", borderLeft: "3px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.22)", paddingLeft: 22}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", marginTop: 8}}>02</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>或者根本没人管</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>最后两层的负责人常常是空缺的。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 20, alignItems: "flex-start", borderLeft: "3px solid #A32D2D", paddingLeft: 22}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", marginTop: 8}}>03</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>更硬的后果</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>只用最上面那层、却忽略权限的团队，会被 agent 的违规反过来惩罚。</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>12 / 45</Text></Box></Box>
